  "tinai": "unknown",
  "sangamTamil": "வழங்காத செல்வரின் நல்கூர்ந்தார் உய்ந்தார்\nஇழந்தா ரெனப்படுதல் உய்ந்தார் - உழந்ததனைக்\nகாப்புய்ந்தார் கல்லுதலும் உய்ந்தார்தங் கைந்நோவ\nயாப்புயந்தார் உய்ந்த பல.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "Poor men better off than churls. The poor have escaped much from which rich men that dispense not suffer. They have escaped the reputation of having lost (their substance). They have escaped the toil of saving it. They have escaped (the labour of) digging (to hide it). They have escaped the ache of hands securing it from powerful plunderers. Many are the (sorrows) they have escaped.",
